<title>JAPAN: Sumitomo Life 96/97 parent results.</title>
<headline>Sumitomo Life 96/97 parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	  (in billions yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Premium income		 3.44 trln   vs	    3.56 trln</p>
<p> Asset Invest Gains	   1.09 trln   vs	    1.17 trln</p>
<p> Insurance Payments	   3.48 trln   vs	    2.57 trln</p>
<p> Asset invest costs	 543.60	  vs	  381.10</p>
<p> Current			303.70	  vs	  366.30</p>
<p> Total assets		  23.39 trln   vs	   23.39 trln</p>
<p> Investment yield	    3.63%	  vs	   3.31%</p>
<p>NOTE - Sumitomo Life Insurance Co is a major life insurance company.</p>
</text>
